Maintainer: Nick McKay <nick@nau.edu>
Description: A wrapper that provides the complete interfaces of the agemodelR (age modeling), ens (ensemble analysis) and lipdViz (visualization) packages for time-uncertain paleogeoscientific data, so that code written against geoChronR 1.x keeps working.
